---
import logo from './images/logo-xen-reverse.svg';
import Link from './Link.astro';
import Section from './Section.astro';
import SectionTitle from './SectionTitle.astro';
---

<Section id="about" labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="mb-12 lg:mb-0 px-0 lg:px-3 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <a
        href="https://xenproject.org"
        class="aspect-video w-full min-h-0 flex flex-col items-center max-h-[400px]"
      >
        <img
          src={logo.src}
          class="block lg:mx-auto rounded max-w-full h-auto object-fill h-full"
          alt="Xen Project logo"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="self-start lg:-order-1 flex flex-col gap-4">
      <SectionTitle id="about-heading" title="About me" />
      <div class="text-2xl">
        Community Manager{' @ '}
        <Link url="https://xenproject.org">Xen Project (Linux Foundation)</Link>
      </div>
      <div class="text-2xl">International Speaker</div>
      <div class="text-2xl">University instructor</div>
      <div class="text-secondary text-justify flex flex-col gap-4">
        <p>
          I’m Cody Zuschlag, Community Manager for the Xen Project, an
          international speaker, and a university instructor based in Annecy,
          France. My experience spans software engineering, developer relations,
          developer advocacy, and teaching, combining technical understanding
          with a passion for helping people learn, contribute, and collaborate.
        </p>
        <p>
          Open source is at the heart of my work. I bring developers,
          maintainers, and industry partners together, organize events like Xen
          Summit, and turn complex technical work into accessible talks and
          content. At Xen, I help build the community and collaborations
          advancing open-source virtualization across cloud infrastructure,
          embedded systems, automotive, and functional safety.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
